                                                "sense_id": "0e58aafd-9adc-39de-9652-26e5f4fc8389",
                                                "text": "A preprocessing (or text normalization) module is necessary as a front end, since TTS [text-to-speech] systems should in principle be able to read any text, including numbers, abbreviations, acronyms, and idiomatics in any format."
